  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk-0292",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "第四部分：简答题",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第1题 请结合你自己的生活经验，说明了解用户需求对设计一个好产品有什么重要性。举一个生活中的例子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0295",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "不了解用户需求，做出来的东西可能没人用，比如老人手机字太小看不清。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0296",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "了解需求才能找准真正的痛点，比如垃圾桶换袋费劲是因为袋子和桶不匹配。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0297",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "用户自己可能说不清需求，要去观察他们的行为才能发现真问题。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0298",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "不同用户需求不同，要分人群设计，比如老人和年轻人的手机需求完全不同。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0299",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "好产品往往解决了用户没说出口的需求，比如超市购物车能上楼梯。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0300",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第2题 请回忆你使用过的一件好用的产品，说说它为什么好用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0302",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "操作简单，不需要看说明书就会用，比如苹果手机。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0303",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "拿在手里很舒服，符合手感，比如游戏手柄的握把设计。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0304",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "功能实用，不多余，没有那些从来用不上的鸡肋功能。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0305",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "用的时候不会出错，容错性好，比如插头正反都能插。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0306",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "用了很久还好好的，质量可靠，比如老式诺基亚手机。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0307",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第3题 请回忆你用过的一件难用的产品，说说它为什么难用，如果让你改，你会怎么改？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0308",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0309",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "哪里难用，具体描述操作过程哪里卡住了，比如遥控器按键太小老按错。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0310",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "为什么设计成这样，猜测原因可能是为了美观牺牲了实用性。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0311",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "怎么改会好用，比如把常用按键做大一点，不常用的放旁边。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0312",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改了之后用户会有什么体验变化，比如老人也能轻松操作了。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0313",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "成本会不会增加很多，其实调整按键大小基本不增加成本。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0314",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第4题 你日常生活中，有没有遇到过被设计照顾到了的瞬间？请描述一个，并说明它为什么是好设计。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0315",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0316",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "描述场景，比如地铁扶手的高度刚好让大部分人够得着。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0317",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "设计在哪里起作用，比如扶手的高度是根据平均身高设计的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0318",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果没这么设计会怎样，比如太高了矮个子够不到。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0319",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这个设计照顾了谁，比如照顾了老人、小孩和个子不高的成年人。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0320",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你觉得设计师是怎么想到这个的，肯定是观察了大量乘客的使用行为。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0321",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第5题 如果让你设计一个给老人用的智能手机，你会从哪些方面考虑？请列出至少5点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0322",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0323",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "字体要大，看得清楚，默认就是大字号模式。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0324",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "声音要大，听得见，通话和铃声都放大。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0325",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "图标要简单，容易理解，不要有复杂的层级菜单。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0326",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "操作步骤要少，每一步都有明确提示，不会迷路。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0327",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "按钮要大，方便手指按，不要那种很小的触控点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0328",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可以设置紧急联系人一键呼叫，遇到情况能快速求助。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0329",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第6题 你平时使用手机App时，哪些细节会让你觉得这个App设计得真贴心？请举3个例子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0330",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0331",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "加载时有个小动画，不无聊，让人知道正在加载而不是死机了。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0332",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "点错了可以撤销，不用重新做一遍，比如邮件发送可以撤回。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0333",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "常用功能放在最容易点到的地方，大拇指自然覆盖的位置。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0334",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "晚上会自动调暗护眼模式，考虑夜间使用的舒适度。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0335",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "下载进度条会显示还剩多少时间，让人有预期。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0336",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第7题 请举例说明你生活中遇到的环保类设计，并说说你对这类设计的看法。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0337",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0338",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "举例，比如纸吸管、可降解塑料袋、自带杯买咖啡减钱等。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0339",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "优点，减少了塑料污染，对环境保护有实际贡献。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0340",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "缺点，有时体验不好，比如纸吸管泡久了会变软。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0341",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进建议，比如纸吸管可以加一层可食用防水涂层。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0342",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "对环保设计的整体态度，支持但要兼顾用户体验。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0343",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第8题 假如你要买一个水杯，你会从哪些方面判断它设计得好不好？请列出至少5条。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0344",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0345",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "手感舒不舒服，握在手里是否贴合手掌。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0346",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "材质安不安全，装热水会不会有异味或者释放有害物质。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0347",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "密封性好不好，倒放或者放包里会不会漏水。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0348",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "好不好清洗，杯盖和杯身能不能拆开彻底清洗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0349",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "容量大小合不合适，日常使用场景需要多大容量。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0350",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "外观看不看，每天使用的东西要赏心悦目。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0351",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "价格合不合理，性价比是否合适。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "7.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0352",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "有没有防烫设计，有把手或者有隔热层不会烫手。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "8.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
